questions.explanation:
The six matrices A for which $|A| = 0$ are as follows:

 \left[ {\matrix{ 0 & 0 & 1  \cr 0 & 0 & 1  \cr 1 & 1 & 1  \cr

} } \right] \Rightarrow  inconsistent.

 \left[ {\matrix{ 0 & 1 & 0  \cr 1 & 1 & 1  \cr 0 & 1 & 0  \cr

} } \right] \Rightarrow  inconsistent.

 \left[ {\matrix{ 1 & 1 & 1  \cr 1 & 0 & 0  \cr 1 & 0 & 0  \cr

} } \right] \Rightarrow  infinite solutions.

 \left[ {\matrix{ 1 & 1 & 0  \cr 1 & 1 & 0  \cr 0 & 0 & 1  \cr

} } \right] \Rightarrow  inconsistent.

 \left[ {\matrix{ 1 & 0 & 1  \cr 0 & 1 & 0  \cr 1 & 0 & 1  \cr

} } \right] \Rightarrow  inconsistent.

 \left[ {\matrix{ 1 & 0 & 0  \cr 0 & 1 & 1  \cr 0 & 1 & 1  \cr

} } \right] \Rightarrow  infinite solutions.
